sequenceDiagram
  participant Molt as molt
  participant DUT as DUT_SSH
  participant Src as video_source
  participant Cmp as rtsp_compressor
  participant Mon as rtsp_monitor

  Molt->>DUT: backup system.yaml
  Molt->>DUT: apply video-rtsp fixture
  Molt->>DUT: systemctl restart odc-onboard-v2
  Molt->>DUT: wait IPC sock
  Molt->>Src: start MP4 RTSP :8554
  Molt->>DUT: graph status assert VID-OPS-01
  Molt->>Cmp: graph components start rtsp_lab
  Note over Cmp: synthetic local binding lo 127.0.0.1
  Molt->>Mon: connect :8555 duration T
  Mon-->>Molt: bitrate frames greater than 0
  Molt->>DUT: inspect caps codec resolution
  Molt->>Cmp: stop then start
  Molt->>Mon: recheck BW
  Molt->>DUT: teardown restore YAML free ports
